{"id":336,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック精神で全人教育を行う札幌光星","feature_description":"札幌光星中学校・高等学校は、カトリックの精神に基づく全人教育を掲げ、一人ひとりの個性を尊重しながら学ぶ学校です。宗教教育やコース制、海外語学研修などが整理され、学習と生活の両面が見えやすくなっています。中学サークル活動も案内されています。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5694,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5695,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5696,"name":"フェンシング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5697,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5698,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5699,"name":"馬術部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5700,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5701,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=20","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5702,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5703,"name":"放送局","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5704,"name":"図書局","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5705,"name":"新聞局","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporokosei.ac.jp/high_school/page.php?id=95",